        "type": "background",
        "image": "bg_ltstreet1.png",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "id": 175,
        "raw": "[Blocker(a=0, r=0, g=0, b=0, fadetime=3, block=true)]",
        "type": "blocker",
        "a": "0,",
        "r": "0,",
        "g": "0,",
        "b": "0,",
        "fadetime": "3,",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "id": 176,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 177,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  ...Miss Folinic, we should have stopped Mr. Severin.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "...Miss Folinic, we should have stopped Mr. Severin."
    },
    {
        "id": 178,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 179,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  No use. You saw them. The pressure's gotten to them.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "No use. You saw them. The pressure's gotten to them."
    },
    {
        "id": 180,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 181,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  Oh... is that so?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "Oh... is that so?"
    },
    {
        "id": 182,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  But if a famine really is as imminent as the officer says, we'll still have to...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "But if a famine really is as imminent as the officer says, we'll still have to..."
    },
    {
        "id": 183,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"char_345_folnic_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 184,
        "raw": "[name=\"Folinic\"]  ...The only way to calm everyone down is to find the murderer as soon as possible. And letting our one lead go cold isn't an option.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Folinic",
        "content": "...The only way to calm everyone down is to find the murderer as soon as possible. And letting our one lead go cold isn't an option."
    },
    {
        "id": 185,
