    {
        "id": 196,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  You know... everyone is burning with rage right now. Nobody has a clear head.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "You know... everyone is burning with rage right now. Nobody has a clear head."
    },
    {
        "id": 197,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  I think... it's just my gut feeling, but my intuition is usually pretty accurate!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "I think... it's just my gut feeling, but my intuition is usually pretty accurate!"
    },
    {
        "id": 198,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  I think maybe... something even worse is starting to happen. The kind of thing that you can't be sure if it's right or wrong...",
        "type": "dialog",
